  "question": {
    "text": "Let M and N be two <math><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math> matrices such that MN = NM. Further, if <math><mi>M</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> , then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Determinant of  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>  is 0",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a  <math><mn>3</mn><mi> </mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math>  non - zero matrix <math><mrow>  <mtext>U</mtext></mrow></math> such that  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>U</mi></math>  is the zero matrix",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Determinant of  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "For a  <math><mn>3</mn><mi> </mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math>  matrix <math><mrow>  <mtext>U</mtext></mrow></math>, if  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>U</mi></math>  equals the zero matrix then <math><mrow>  <mtext>U</mtext></mrow></math> is the zero matrix",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A",
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>0</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>0</mi></math> (As M, N commute.)<br />Also, <math><mi>M</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />As <math><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is not null <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Also <math><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> There exist non - null U such that <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>0</mi></math>"
  }
